  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dutch Global Partnership on OutputBased Aid (GPOBA) Water and Sanitation Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of the trust fund is to enable developing member countries accelerate economic development by providing subsidy funding to support the delivery of basic services in water and sanitation. The subsidy funding is linked at least in part to the delivery of specified services or other outputs by service providers (public or private; profit or non-profit). Examples include(1) schemes to improve the affordability of consumption of basic services by low-income populations; (ii) schemes intended to improvethe efficient delivery of services that exhibit positive externalities; and (iii) schemes intended to facilitate the transition tocost-recovery tariffs.</narrative>
  </description>
